    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32210" root="غلت" body-key="g">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغلّتهُ</span></b>  <i>He took him in a state of inadvertence,</i>
or <i>heedlessness;</i> (K, TA;) the doing of which (i. e.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّغَلُّتُ</span>) is said in a trad. to be not allowable;
(TA:) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتلتهُ</span></b> . (K, TA.)

